01:20:24.742 --> 01:20:27.259
&gt;&gt; Nominated and chosen by their peers,

01:20:27.259 --> 01:20:32.136
the recipient of the Ernest C Arbuckle
award is a second year MBA student,

01:20:32.136 --> 01:20:36.922
who by there active participation-
Initiative, leadership and

01:20:36.922 --> 01:20:41.822
personal integrity, is judged as having
contributed most to the fulfillment of

01:20:41.822 --> 01:20:46.218
the goals of the Stanford Graduate School
of Business in their actions,

01:20:46.218 --> 01:20:49.110
both within school and society.

01:20:49.110 --> 01:20:51.301
The recipient receives a cash prize,

01:20:51.301 --> 01:20:54.527
and also has their name on
a plaque on display at the GSB.

01:20:54.527 --> 01:20:56.843
We are delighted to have Susan Arbuckle,

01:20:56.843 --> 01:20:59.435
the daughter of
Ernie Arbuckle with us today.

01:20:59.435 --> 01:21:04.917
&gt;&gt; [APPLAUSE]
The MBA class

01:21:04.917 --> 01:21:10.688
of 2020 Arbuckle Award winner

01:21:10.688 --> 01:21:16.266
is Ryan please stand.

