&gt;&gt; [APPLAUSE]

01:21:30.496 --> 01:21:32.442
&gt;&gt; I really enjoyed the procession I had

01:21:32.442 --> 01:21:36.351
some great flashbacks to a trip to
Beijing with many of you a few years ago.

01:21:36.351 --> 01:21:38.677
&gt;&gt; [APPLAUSE] That was great.

01:21:38.677 --> 01:21:43.237
The Alexander Robert Check Student
Achievement Award in finance was

01:21:43.237 --> 01:21:48.191
established to honor Professor Robert
Check outstanding contribution to

01:21:48.191 --> 01:21:53.470
the teaching of finance at the GSB
from 1960, until his death in 1978.

01:21:53.470 --> 01:21:58.390
The award is given to an MBA students
selected by the finance faculty for

01:21:58.390 --> 01:22:03.067
outstanding achievement in their
finance courses, the recipient

01:22:03.067 --> 01:22:09.160
receives the award and also has their
name on a plaque on display at the GSB.

01:22:09.160 --> 01:22:15.332
The MBA class of 2020 recipient of the
robot check award is Timothy Francis Brown

01:22:15.332 --> 01:22:18.808
&gt;&gt; [APPLAUSE]

01:22:18.808 --> 01:22:21.298
&gt;&gt; [APPLAUSE]

01:22:21.298 --> 01:22:25.673
&gt;&gt; There he is, congratulations.

01:22:25.673 --> 01:22:28.606
&gt;&gt; [APPLAUSE]
&gt;&gt; And finally,

01:22:28.606 --> 01:22:30.222
among the RJ Miller scholars,

01:22:30.222 --> 01:22:34.710
one student's academic achievement
places them at the top of the class.

01:22:34.710 --> 01:22:38.980
This student is designated as
the Henry Ford II scholar.

01:22:38.980 --> 01:22:41.991
&gt;&gt; And receives,
along with the Miller Scholar Scroll,

01:22:41.991 --> 01:22:46.930
a significant cash award and their
name on a plaque displayed at the GSB.

01:22:46.930 --> 01:22:53.106
The MBA class of 2020
Henry Ford II Scholar is Nathaniel Segal.

01:22:53.106 --> 01:22:57.995
&gt;&gt; [APPLAUSE]

01:22:57.995 --> 01:23:03.301
&gt;&gt; [APPLAUSE] Honored guests, faculty,

01:23:03.301 --> 01:23:07.777
staff, families and friends,

01:23:07.777 --> 01:23:14.590
we have reached the conclusion
of our ceremony.

01:23:15.850 --> 01:23:18.890
In a moment I'm going to ask
all of you to join us for

01:23:18.890 --> 01:23:21.790
a reception just outside
the gates of Frost.

01:23:22.980 --> 01:23:25.524
Class of 2020, will you please rise?

01:23:29.436 --> 01:23:31.961
In the spirit of what
Orlando said earlier,

01:23:31.961 --> 01:23:35.450
I'd like everyone to join me
in one final class of 2020.

01:23:35.450 --> 01:23:36.749
Let's go.

01:23:36.749 --> 01:23:41.080
One, two, three Class of 2020.

01:23:41.080 --> 01:23:42.062
Let's go.

01:23:42.062 --> 01:23:53.050
&gt;&gt; [APPLAUSE]

01:23:53.050 --> 01:23:55.956
&gt;&gt; Congratulations class of 2020,

01:23:55.956 --> 01:23:58.972
you may recess from the amphitheater.

01:23:58.972 --> 01:24:03.974
&gt;&gt; [APPLAUSE]

01:24:03.974 --> 01:24:13.974
&gt;&gt; [MUSIC]

